# pstack — ReadyForRobots Cloud defaults

Cloud agents often have no `~/.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc`. Use inherit-parent / auto unless the operator has a local setup-pstack rule.

Jobs work uses `how` (ownership) plus verify-readyforrobots. After UI copy, unslop.

Never Hermes. Never Vercel AI Gateway. Never put pstack on the website.

FIND is `/`. Matcher is `POST /api/robot-job-match`. See `docs/pstack_jobs.md` and `docs/hermes_retired.md`.
